==History==
2024
*The Rocket Silo [[Cards|card]] was made available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Rocket Silo Challenge]], which started on 8/7/2024.
*On 15/7/2024, the Rocket Silo was removed from the game.

==Trivia==
*The first use of rockets were in 1232, when reports appeared describing fire arrows and 'iron pots' that could be heard for 25 kilometers when they exploded upon impact, causing devastation for a radius of 600 meters, apparently due to shrapnel. A "flying fire-lance" that had reusable barrels was also mentioned to have been used by the Jin dynasty. Rockets are recorded to have been used by the Song navy in a military exercise dated to 1245. Rockets are still used to this day for multiple purposes, whether that is military, science, and entertainment.
**The Rocket Silo is 1 of 5 [[cards]] associated with rocketry, with the others being [[Firecracker]], [[Rocket]], [[Goblin Machine]], and [[Party Rocket]].
*The Rocket Silo's stats are the highest or lowest among all [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]]. More specifically:
**The Rocket Silo has the highest hitpoints of all buildings, with 2,905 hitpoints at Level 15.
**Among all buildings that can attack, the Rocket Silo has the highest damage of all buildings, with 2,325 damage at Level 15.
*The Rocket Silo is the only building that does not decay its hitpoints, despite having a lifetime stat.

